      <p begin="00:00.210" end="00:04.760" ttm:agent="v1">밤, 바바바바밤, 바바바바밤, 바바바바밤</p>
      <p begin="00:04.760" end="00:09.880" ttm:agent="v1">밤, 바바바바밤, 바바바바밤, 바바바바밤</p>
      <p begin="00:09.880" end="00:14.330" ttm:agent="v1">제일 높은 곳에 난 닿길 원해, 느꼈어 내 answer</p>
      <p begin="00:14.330" end="00:18.660" ttm:agent="v1">내 혈관 속에 날뛰는 new wave, 내 거대한 passion</p>
      <p begin="00:18.660" end="00:23.650" ttm:agent="v1">관심 없어 과거에 모두가 알고 있는 그 trouble에, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:23.650" end="00:28.090" ttm:agent="v1">I'm fearless, a new bitch, new crazy, 올라가, next one</p>
      <p begin="00:28.090" end="00:32.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Woah-oh-oh-oh-oh) 밟아줘, highway, highway</p>
