      <p begin="00:37.160" end="00:41.770" ttm:agent="v1">내 흉짐도 나의 일부라면</p>
      <p begin="00:41.770" end="00:46.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Woah-oh-oh-oh-oh) 겁이 난 없지, 없지</p>
      <p begin="00:46.850" end="00:48.960" ttm:agent="v1">What you lookin' at? What you, what you lookin' at?</p>
